  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SwedBio - the Millenium Ecosystem Assessment      follow-up 2006-2011 - SwedBio MA followup</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SwedBio - the Millenium Ecosystem Assessment      uppf&#xf6;ljning 2006-11</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">5. The Swedish International Biodiversity Programme, SwedBio, har     utvecklat ett program f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d till uppf&#xf6;ljning av Millennium         Ecosystem Assessment (MA).St&#xf6;det inkluderar 18 MSEK f&#xf6;r perioden      2006-2008, ytterligare 6 MSEK f&#xf6;r perioden 2007-2008 samt 4 MSEK i en f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngning f&#xf6;r 2010.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish International Biodiversity Programme, SwedBio, has        developed a programme that will promote globally strategic follow-up  actions to the Millennium Ecosystem Assessment (MA). The support      includes 18 MSEK over the period 2006-2008, an additional 6 MSEK for  the period 2007-2008 and 4 MSEK for an extension for 2010.</narrative>
  </description>
